As was pointed out (by myself), you can get an artifact with a luck of
zero. The chances of getting an artifact are not modified by your luck,
and neither are they by the monster value. If the sacrifice was consumed
without any further message (and the player is level 3 or more), then
that sacrifice already had full potential for obtaining a gift.

The starting chances are 1-in-10. So that about 10% of characters will
get an artifact upon their first sacrifice on a co-aligned altar. It
happens.


